      "reason": "The per-basin headline means depend on the WOA23 basin mask, with marginal seas folded into parent oceans and the Southern and Arctic Oceans treated as separate basins excluded from the Atlantic/Pacific/Indian statistics.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Basin means use the WOA23 `basinmask_01` (`load_basin_mask`, `select_basin`) with `include_marginal_seas=True`, as the question prescribes; state that the OMIP 10-region Ofx `basin` field is absent locally and a WOA labelling was used instead.",
